Do not touch unless explicitly amended by the human:

```text
src/**
tools/**
tests/**
backend/**
groundtruth/**
plans/plan-13-weighted-consensus-ir-real-outputs.md
plans/plan-14-linkedstructure-cross-page-semantic-linking.md
plans/plan-15-docling-export-validation.md
project.md
PLAN_TEMPLATE.md
pyproject.toml
